      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KOBE ROSE (1) eye-catching debut run after settling well back but winding up strongly into the frame when second (24.95) at this track over 435m. Gets the coveted rails draw for the first time. Better for the run and makes appeal this time. OMEGA KIANNA (3) ran a nice race on debut when hitting the frame, finishing second (20.43) at Traralgon over 350m. Can find the frame again this time. DR. POSEIDON (2) still a maiden after six runs but rarely out of the placings. Was below best last time when missed the frame finishing third (24.72) at Traralgon. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Overdue and gets his chance. DR. DOLORES (8) is not to be discarded.",
